# 统一换行符：仓库在 Windows 上检出时被 core.autocrlf 写成了 CRLF，
# 导致 404 个文件在 diff 里表现为"整体修改"。这里强制 LF 并禁止再转回去。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：不做任何换行符/文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.pkl binary
*.bin binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.mp4 binary
*.hevc binary
